THIRD-PARTY RUNTIME DEPENDENCIES
================================

This package declares no production ("dependencies") third-party packages and
bundles no third-party runtime code in its published `dist/` output. The
compiled output imports only peer dependencies the consumer installs
(vue, @ezclassify/types, @ezclassify/ui), which ship their own license and
notice files.

There is therefore no third-party copyright or license obligation carried by
this package's runtime.

Build- and test-time tooling (devDependencies) is not distributed and is not
listed here.
